{"message":"The reserve for product warranties moved from $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 to $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 (post_text q11). Rather than simply subtracting the two endpoints, I build the change from the disclosed roll-forward components for 2006: pretax charges against income $4 million (q12), warranty obligations assumed in 2006 acquisitions $7 million (q14), less cash outlays $5 million (q13). Net change = 4 + 7 - 5. This ties to the ending balance: 4 + 6 = 10, matching the $10 million Dec. 31, 2006 reserve. Amounts are in millions of USD as stated in the document.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"4 + 7 - 5","variables":{"charges_2006":{"value":4,"source":"source:q12n0","unit":"USD_million"},"assumed_in_acquisitions":{"value":7,"source":"source:q14n0","unit":"USD_million"},"cash_outlays_2006":{"value":5,"source":"source:q13n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"charges_2006":"source:q12n0","assumed_in_acquisitions":"source:q14n0","cash_outlays_2006":"source:q13n0"}}}